与 MCP 黑盒调用的可调试性。", "materiality": "material", "query_text_basis": "“可调试性”"}, {"aspect_id": "PQS_V1_Q011_A4", "description": "说明 MCP 在多租户、权限和标准化安装场景的保留优势。", "materiality": "material", "query_text_basis": "“怎么取舍”"}], "review_state": "draft", "source_review_state": {"authoritative_sources_reviewable": true, "full_authoritative_transcript_reviewed": true, "navigation_sources_used_as_gold_evidence": false}, "span_registry": [{"end_time": 674.4, "quote_text": "我认为MCP对比CLI主要有以下几个劣势 首先MCP上下文占用较高 MCP需要将所有的工具名字参数格式 还有调用示例全部注入上下文 每新增一个MCP工具都要占用大量的token开销 而CLI则可以让A自己学习用法 使用渐进式披露的方式来减少token消耗 scale kit做过一组测试 使用GITHUB的官方MCP与官方CLI进行对比 在所有任务上面 CLI的token消耗都成倍的小于MCP第二点", "segment_identity_version": "v3.5-source-identity-v2", "segment_ids": ["segment_0f49da7b3e976284f5d4de1713fe8b26d07a3b0fa3521d3e8611139ee3267937", "segment_259d7f28d90fc775b3d61429e99f09f327234e5257205d8092a7924dac172155", "segment_17f9cfa6d3765e8ccd5c65d8d921851492d3d0aeeccca688e37417b4e9ce0c19", "segment_9db236b56cd16ee5859aa85e4634ca5f565f85eab311db15f7c6bc13e8a72804", "segment_46d9885baab39e7d1fac170f05605ccb4cb8695a86a6347543e186d383029508", "segment_d545f7ba134cb1a0ef6b645f4e72e1db52a232cc1ecf18b9126986bee5b2a26d", "segment_c56a1a53d2451c5116a85f7a445ca12f476b2ba3496385fc39a6a822c52f608a", "segment_6412138e620a12ff64c12ab30bcde557553c1ebc8f3b5f7ed2ffd5d07070ddc6", "segment_d709c39513834766a20b6b243445929637353f2a937cc3340a65f3eb04e20ed2", "segment_181e638309afa537daf9ef4e07208e361776b52677efdb0e80f50625e29c0d33", "segment_50aa58831a2a5032e0b0a44db769b42d338ae3ea3d279f14d90d8816a7e2296b"], "source_language": "zh", "source_quality_flag": "clean", "source_type": "official_subtitle", "source_version": "6555e8b2118e80ae3bf504f543fb6dfd013da65181ab45a9d9df773c4b165b36", "span_id": "PQS_V1_Q011_SPAN_01", "start_time": 640.34, "timeline_run_id": "timeline_run_c65dd15fa2b74d05f30778278863c74719df1844c765a7e4ebcd145d0dff8092", "translated_gloss": null, "video_id": "bilibili:BV1G29EBGE8b"}, {"end_time": 760.66, "quote_text": "第三点是CLI天生支持管道服操作 可以将多个命令组装成流水线 轻松实现复杂任务 这种组合能力是MCP不具备的 我们来看一个例子 我们先使用GITHUBCLI获取open cloud艺术列表 这个竖线是管道符 意思是把上个命令的输出结果作为下个命令的输入 可以像拼接管道一样把命令组合起来 形成一条流水线 通过管道符 我们可以先把数据转换成一个power shell对象 在每条数据里面筛选出包含bug这个字符串的 再根据时间进行排序 最后导出成一个CSV文件 这样我们就通过管道符串联了流水线 一条命令就能轻松实现复杂需求 如果我们使用MCP处理这种任务 就需要非常多步骤的反复调用工具 大大增加了token消耗跟时间开销", "segment_identity_version": "v3.5-source-identity-v2", "segment_ids": ["segment_0384bdd05466747abcd5afa762b02d58ebd43d16f2b1af37766a8bb66a67d6b8", "segment_29c48d5e501a31a5dc449a8b94ee6ef1b3834c5c5c8cf394cf3bf29030dbf74f", "segment_1d3c75295154865a5462cfa03d98c2370eabae3fc028dbb8005aa0d182dec3fd", "segment_e6f314f432a128fea23e6de7474b05b233d65c60253667a9b092c40a38594b6f", "segment_ff4c3c0ec2a9fe1b5f3f49a9a5ee0467673fb883f29ba043023c51197e916e54", "segment_7c38c3b3dd0b668b588f775751e5ab48e0be14962fa3b834effa8b200f6f926b", "segment_412bc69a0072f4b59a89fe743d4a10ec0c86b98c132487a892323acdf7de02f2", "segment_6072b17dca537a1e075f63bf9782c9e641a1e06037c13a155b5b61aaf8966459", "segment_a2819c62ec325c7c27fea3b1ec5daeb5b57debb5660a7cdf6b7f0c45dd7aa76c", "segment_62766242595c0c68ba79695e4571ebd6b1a98c607389447faaf9f08eef4dd8d9", "segment_8c52098b8dd3cc47e2f9e850c3cf4786b094acc9034562947a8aac7274ddce54", "segment_66cf1ffd740bcfd474894f5918c392f7a3f52aaa858260409d1e33fa3495c86d", "segment_50a3ca76f16c7255003ecee7a55491e5673357b50f85467047664973c855f81c", "segment_59498a74837315bfb62b29b4d561acd46decf61df10dc80d2c9094c56d6ab814", "segment_0f12e6bc458f221814859534ba292bf56c3b270e5b80cc7c79cdf180ac6b4072", "segment_381d903d9cb31ddfe4542fbc708c2bf5338b89f39e61b28149ff6010457d9b53", "segment_9eed82d06e870883742395711c84967aecf7f2da35ee646de30d6cb7e29f4ef8", "segment_d053c4d33443c735f2e5cee12173dc890921568790330902e80fd00b638078c0", "segment_ea4214d3c32d1c81a363b52a68652d0a8b4630ab87cbe9183c6e63dc63d08c5a", "segment_ede9083a251a5185267ac504c1cf678af31302166cd39ac8449bf6c784db871d"], "source_language": "zh", "source_quality_flag": "clean", "source_type": "official_subtitle", "source_version": "6555e8b2118e80ae3bf504f543fb6dfd013da65181ab45a9d9df773c4b165b36", "span_id": "PQS_V1_Q011_SPAN_02", "start_time": 709.12, "timeline_run_id": "timeline_run_c65dd15fa2b74d05f30778278863c74719df1844c765a7e4ebcd145d0dff8092", "translated_gloss": null, "video_id": "bilibili:BV1G29EBGE8b"}, {"end_time": 709.12, "quote_text": "MCP更像是一个agent的专用协议 而CLI是一个同时对agent跟人类友好的工具 我们还是来看刚才那个GITHUB的例子 比如我让agent用GITHUBCLI创建一个分支 在这里报错了 在这个场景下面 我只需要把命令复制一下 开一个命令行窗口运行一下 就能立即复现出错误原因 而且我还可以协助AI进行修复 而MCP对人类来说更像是一个黑盒 整个运行过程都是在agent的内部的 如果运行出错 很难在本地复现问题 调试的难度大大增加", "segment_identity_version": "v3.5-source-identity-v2", "segment_ids": ["segment_f9b9806ffa2365c480230d9dbd898d98446c7f49f2b7e3b64482e737976d207e", "segment_b459a8f73ea8d5e2a146c5ef3ac165ba3cb41c4a0854d69b848e27d23d80c27c", "segment_2ec9e68af83d736d772f96b1713a45053762b692bdfa50c275b1c0d793cc8a7a", "segment_2f786ad1b1e430a367f7c221a0cf7878b0c5db84b26ce17bff618926d2990293", "segment_37125a9fc9884825c73286c7a7664787e1a61253869392e3b77deb4e0a11dd70", "segment_458d43fefb415e79ae9c37d40d100469a6f616eae031997f3a0507989ad4873d", "segment_0f1c4c3e06204f7ec8c70601738b87b50e625addf5770940120d5d26804636fd", "segment_b70b728ba61034db09fcdb721b3afc6c84d9a622133f26fc5f9aa86f44920dc1", "segment_e5d796b81fee35abecb51a1b4f8b34e3862ede1594d22b9fea026709ae865c64", "segment_aaa965b906d651bdaf24e5bf1be4c3aea47d93ef6acf1609cb8a230f586a81cc", "segment_3c6bab41f89be040fc711af95f9ee3656ef8377f65af018859292bfed5169a02", "segment_ac96b362ee1ade6e28e79007154c8b1c52a472b25d40a5044e163e6c5a9909d0", "segment_3f5dc99a73bf20c9049b9c297cea07c5de0b0e11f83cf9e92233e5668489f052", "segment_caefbe83c220116b76fd297692c7d3db5f2329b528615c0299a7b56900fc0825", "segment_46895b70a34a24f986833019245e52554cbf5fcbc343d09ea29fe39d2d9e235b"], "source_language": "zh", "source_quality_flag": "clean", "source_type": "official_subtitle", "source_version": "6555e8b2118e80ae3bf504f543fb6dfd013da65181ab45a9d9df773c4b165b36", "span_id": "PQS_V1_Q011_SPAN_03", "start_t