{"acceptable_evidence_groups": [{"group_id": "PQS_V1_Q012_GROUP_01", "required_span_sets": [{"required_span_ids": ["PQS_V1_Q012_SPAN_01"], "set_id": "PQS_V1_Q012_GROUP_SET_01"}, {"required_span_ids": ["PQS_V1_Q012_SPAN_02"], "set_id": "PQS_V1_Q012_GROUP_SET_02"}, {"required_span_ids": ["PQS_V1_Q012_SPAN_03"], "set_id": "PQS_V1_Q012_GROUP_SET_03"}, {"required_span_ids": ["PQS_V1_Q012_SPAN_04"], "set_id": "PQS_V1_Q012_GROUP_SET_04"}], "required_span_sets_within_group": "AND"}], "acceptable_evidence_groups_logic": "OR", "aspect_evidence_options": [{"alternative_sets": [{"required_span_ids": ["PQS_V1_Q012_SPAN_01"], "set_id": "PQS_V1_Q012_A1_SET_01"}], "alternative_sets_between": "OR", "aspect_id": "PQS_V1_Q012_A1", "required_spans_within_set": "AND"}, {"alternative_sets": [{"required_span_ids": ["PQS_V1_Q012_SPAN_02"], "set_id": "PQS_V1_Q012_A2_SET_01"}], "alternative_sets_between": "OR", "aspect_id": "PQS_V1_Q012_A2", "required_spans_within_set": "AND"}, {"alternative_sets": [{"required_span_ids": ["PQS_V1_Q012_SPAN_03"], "set_id": "PQS_V1_Q012_A3_SET_01"}], "alternative_sets_between": "OR", "aspect_id": "PQS_V1_Q012_A3", "required_spans_within_set": "AND"}, {"alternative_sets": [{"required_span_ids": ["PQS_V1_Q012_SPAN_04"], "set_id": "PQS_V1_Q012_A4_SET_01"}], "alternative_sets_between": "OR", "aspect_id": "PQS_V1_Q012_A4", "required_spans_within_set": "AND"}], "builder_or_retrieval_output_limits_gold": false, "gold_version": "PRODUCT_QUERY_GOLD_V1_REVIEWER_A_INDEPENDENT_DRAFT_V1", "optional_context_spans": [], "query_id": "PQS_V1_Q012", "reason_codes": ["EG_COMPLETE_ACCEPTABLE_GROUP", "EG_MATERIAL_ASPECT_SUPPORTED", "EG_ASR_QUALITY_DEGRADED"], "required_aspects": [{"aspect_id": "PQS_V1_Q012_A1", "description": "说明 RAG 代码检索的切分、嵌入、索引和检索路径及其工程效率。", "materiality": "material", "query_text_basis": "“相对 RAG”"}, {"aspect_id": "PQS_V1_Q012_A2", "description": "说明 shell 探索能同时建立项目架构与依赖理解的优势。", "materiality": "material", "query_text_basis": "“shell 命令找代码”的优势"}, {"aspect_id": "PQS_V1_Q012_A3", "description": "说明 shell 路线对模型能力、上下文噪音和 token 消耗的代价。", "materiality": "material", "query_text_basis": "“代价是什么”"}, {"aspect_id": "PQS_V1_Q012_A4", "description": "总结选择取决于把复杂度放在工程侧还是模型侧。", "materiality": "material", "query_text_basis": "“优势和代价”的取舍"}], "review_state": "draft", "source_review_state": {"authoritative_sources_reviewable": true, "full_authoritative_transcript_reviewed": true, "navigation_sources_used_as_gold_evidence": false}, "span_registry": [{"end_time": 89.19, "quote_text": "那么在re的方案中会做以下几件事，首先是trking把代码库切成一个个小块，一个函数作为一个块，或者一个类为一个块，像这里的三个函数就会被切割成三块，接着是embedding和indexing，将每个块压缩成一串数字坐标。 语义越接近，坐标就会越接近。 比如说authentication和login就会非常接近。 同时还会提取关键字一起放到数据库里。 最后是retrieval。 当用户询问问题的时候，就把问题转化成数字坐标也提取关键字出来，和数据库里的快做比较，找出最接近的快作为上下文提供给模型。 所以这套流程你可以看到reg其实是一个非常现代高效的上下文方案。", "segment_identity_version": "v3.5-source-identity-v2", "segment_ids": ["segment_a0e612faad3578315d18d4c375f824b6b5a4448f0ba731add29bd34dd490c9b7", "segment_976244ac6d767e5891c0d14285c45e92d395295484947c9f726528b7e52c2323", "segment_cd5ac31e5b4ff355cbeceab4ccdaf474638c5f557fab107204c99d1edce9071b", "segment_a1e4dc5d95691aa6bf2ec826aa223c9c0fd8a16b2a4bf295461924ea7e64467a", "segment_fbea4d6518dba56bcb8e8b428916625dd48ccf5a8b4fd1072ef350b23f77fd3a", "segment_0f813a8ee60b3fb6e973daf927c0a074b70c5b6176cc69883916615699dc0e09", "segment_03b334eff4ce674a5064e689151cfc560fb9f0a9d45f4f42592748fab659901a"], "source_language": "und", "source_quality_flag": "minor_asr_noise", "source_type": "asr_transcript", "source_version": "6767c30380e6d20b95790cf1aa4fef0db01ff6ec4d3aa10dfaf57fefeabcafd2", "span_id": "PQS_V1_Q012_SPAN_01", "start_time": 43.6, "timeline_run_id": "timeline_run_73a4ed7acd9f552b700d2d2e8c698678ab02a300561137ddb4340c709cfae910", "translated_gloss": null, "video_id": "bilibili:BV18NLx6fEAq"}, {"end_time": 120.19, "quote_text": "还是刚刚那个问题，如果你在cloud code里面问，那么工作流程大概是先用l寻找各种可能的文件命名，然后再进一步用grab搜索文件内容。 这个参索过程其实和人类工程师的做法是一样的，虽然看起来不太高效，但优点是在这个探索过程中，cloud也在了解项目，除了可以搞清楚一开始问的问题，还能顺带了解项目的架构、模块之间的依赖关系等等。", "segment_identity_version": "v3.5-source-identity-v2", "segment_ids": ["segment_0b933a2b104f9ee788f167563e73a3fdf7ca73fbf0e88fd34d890ea6be1be2ee", "segment_a3d7e6b780d070594c71769ae6773d40d550d11a9d0176aca42f67391b9bb032"], "source_language": "und", "source_quality_flag": "minor_asr_noise", "source_type": "asr_transcript", "source_version": "6767c30380e6d20b95790cf1aa4fef0db01ff6ec4d3aa10dfaf57fefeabcafd2", "span_id": "PQS_V1_Q012_SPAN_02", "start_time": 94.67, "timeline_run_id": "timeline_run_73a4ed7acd9f552b700d2d2e8c698678ab02a300561137ddb4340c709cfae910", "translated_gloss": null, "video_id": "bilibili:BV18NLx6fEAq"}, {"end_time": 165.48, "quote_text": "但代价就是这种做法对模型的要求比较高，无用的过程信息会记入上下文，对没那么聪明的模型来说是噪音会影响表现，更不用说这样的探索还会大量消耗token，不过这两点对于cloud来说都是可接受的，cloud模型本身足够聪明，不会被噪音影响。 而token的消耗对于anthroic这种本身就是卖模型的公司来说又很喜闻乐见，所以既有好的模型又靠token赚钱，cloud code只使用share命令就非常水到渠成了，但curser是一个模型无关的产品，它的目标应该是所有模型都能有不错的表现。 所以，与其让模型自由探索，不如做一个更可靠的，让各种模型都能表现的不错。", "segment_identity_version": "v3.5-source-identity-v2", "segment_ids": ["segment_4eaaa2dc51b4f0d434dcbcfb69dd9e502a589c9cebd1792b158cf2f9c8994e86", "segment_81fbd164893dc3df63a41c42f439da8b1f2cc40d6c8bd415a88dde81bcc69174", "segment_164cd5e0a799afd973365ce8ebd59894386ef6fa1b8bcabc8d442e0fc85b51bd"], "source_language": "und", "source_quality_flag": "minor_asr_noise", "source_type": "asr_transcript", "source_version": "6767c30380e6d20b95790cf1aa4fef0db01ff6ec4d3aa10dfaf57fefeabcafd2", "span_id": "PQS_V1_Q012_SPAN_03", "start_time": 120.82, "timeline_run_id": "timeline_run_73a4ed7acd9f552b700d2d2e8c698678ab02a300561137ddb4340c709cfae910", "translated_gloss": null, "video_id": "bilibili:BV18NLx6fEAq"}, {"end_time": 179.82, "quote_text": "所以两种方案都有代价，只是代价落在了不同的地方。 Rank把复杂度放在了工程侧，而项命令把复杂度会放在模型侧。 因此，你要选择哪个，取决于你更相信工程还是更相信模型。", "segment_identity_version": "v3.5-source-identity-v2", "segment_ids": ["segment_7f0ad6016eb9292f1f57fd0acf55ee5fd015bcafd169174aa0770eefeb7e25f8", "segment_bd8f42ea1840c81ca334808eda3992868dbb290103984c09a72869f5a239413a", "segment_8758121c5e9672fbab9d82bc771053a68e66231d56f6c9e0c4ce6cb0f8a3f827"], "source_language": "und", "source_quality_flag": "minor_asr_noise", "source_type": "asr_transcript", "source_version": "6767c30380e6d20b95790cf1aa4fef0db01ff6ec4d3aa10dfaf57fefeabcafd2", "span_id": "PQS_V1_Q012_SPAN_04", "start_time": 165.98, "timeline_run_id": "timeline_run_73a4ed7acd9f552b700d2d2e8c698678ab02a300561137ddb4340c709cfae910", "translated_gloss": null, "video_id": "bilibili:BV18NLx6fEAq"}]}
